{"job_id":"F-376570f69540bbeddc47","family_id":"F-376570f69540bbeddc47","title":"말레이시아산 합판에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":30,"target_id":"69e9e9a95f9a5bbf9bdaed88f5ddd76617dff42665d1658f7c715d3d5d273358","source_hash":"b2ea32e69da0e01dfc1cdaa2b84237dbcc279758e1101a6a52641c7dd40aa7e0","text":"关于对马来西亚胶合板征收反倾销税的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"6e0589d61551f4cebcf47a8a026dec583466137ae3d3853f80761b61f76bb30f","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":243,"target_id":"ebc7c54f5846b3b9cd6d6cbddd6eb267ad408e8714c50e566f41490b067b98c6","source_hash":"540d6c1bc05364aaf3f1b60e2544e5224a39494d8f053ff07d90280c16a6bd31","text":"第二条（征税对象） 应征收反倾销税的货物为马来西亚产胶合板（根据《海关法实施令》第98条第1款，指海关和统计协调制度税号4412.31、4412.33或4412.34对应的胶合板），厚度为6毫米（mm）以上。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":243,"end":318,"target_id":"7dd4fd6f37ce7d1f38cddf26b8e03846c0470d9b413da767086f42541685104d","source_hash":"2a9a883534d346b34789a4e35bdba50415b359f2b1157b2c69b6940aa7b3ebdb","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第二条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":318,"end":340,"target_id":"993d9bfc2e93c7fdbd4646ff86f0e6f0757af92bd81e6b001d9a613dbc81e791","source_hash":"6b3c83588bc38938b36418fb0c515bdc040b2300a8c7cbfad7fc528bcf217f90","text":"补充规定 <第1075号，2024年7月2日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":340,"end":370,"target_id":"8bdef9a2075ce65f2e6213a1de938dde06fe2ee205f35a7b4af9868438aeb653","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":370,"end":408,"target_id":"bfd304a7ca7aa834fed4892bcad09454afa7244d753b20cdb46f8382cdca18d6","source_hash":"183d72790e621b013e8abef61a83e88b16c9786072b353343cb89f76f2b1daf3","text":"第二条（有效期）本规则自公布之日起有效期为五年。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"BODY","start":408,"end":2193,"target_id":"f887f8dcd720158ac2935a5983bac27ee8d525d62eed00136a961170a83237d1","source_hash":"439268660d2f0d1af01e4201477afbab030939afd19825a4d7f60410b140eb12","text":"第三条（适用于复审期间已采取反倾销措施的货物）本规则适用于2023年11月6日或之后申报进口的货物。\n\n供应商对受征税货物的反倾销税税率（与第3条相关）\n■ 对马来西亚胶合板征收反倾销税的规则 [附表] \n\n  供应商对受征税货物征收的反倾销税税率（与第3条相关）                         \n\n┌───┬───────────────────────────┬─────┐\n\n│供应国│供应商│反倾销│\n\n│ │ │关税率(%) │\n\n├───┼───────────────────────────┼─────┤\n\n│Male │1. 下列各款所列公司及其产品出口商 │7.82 │\n\n│Lee Sia│ A. Shin Yang (新阳胶合板有限公司) │ │\n\n│ │ B. Forescom (Forescom Plywood SDN BHD) │ │\n\n│ │ C. Shin Yang Bintulu (Shin Yang Plywood Bintulu SDN BHD) │ │\n\n│ │ D. Zedtee (Zedtee Plywood SDN BHD) │ │\n\n│      ├───────────────────────────┼─────┤\n\nMTQ78c0a9e0da5bc45100201开始│ │2. Subur Tiasa (Subur Tiasa Plywood SDN BHD) 及 │38.10 │\n\n│ │公司产品出口人 │ │\n\n│      ├───────────────────────────┼─────┤\n\nMTQ78c0a9e0da5bc45100203开始│ │3. Jaya Tiasa (Jaya Tiasa Timber Products SDN BHD) │38.10 │\n\n│ │以及出口公司产品的人 │ │\n\n│      ├───────────────────────────┼─────┤\n\n│ │4. 华森单板胶合板工业有限公司 │4.73 │\n\n│ │BHD) 以及出口该公司产品的公司 │ │\n\n│      ├───────────────────────────┼─────┤\n\nMTQ78c0a9e0da5bc45100207开始│ │5.出口Sinora (Sinora SDN BHD)及其产品 │38.10 │\n\n│ │做这件事的人 │ │\n\n│      ├───────────────────────────┼─────┤\n\n│ │6. 其他供应商 │10.67 │\n\n└───┴───────────────────────────┴─────┘\n\n  备注：海关法实施令第6款及第1至5款规定的供应商     \n\n  根据第23条第1款存在特殊关系的情况下，供应商根据第6款可获得奖金        \n\n  尽管存在反骄傲税税率，但与此相关的第 1 至 5 项        \n\n"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00001","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874725","source_hash":"896f6d974e7de817f934a1170227ed1f9982ae18d959889fd80a629206df0d0e","text":"■ 关于对马来西亚胶合板征收反倾销税的规则 [附表]"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00002","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874726","source_hash":"b2557616408002db2e76f4d39c5f4f58ecf1824b4175256f69711133de8c22dd","text":"供应商对受征税货物征收的反倾销税税率（与第3条相关）"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00003","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874727","source_hash":"9057a140b104aa67f60e9c45dc9063205fec9d111bc706a44fb3b0813d12907b","text":"供应商国家"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00004","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874728","source_hash":"b84abfbe481c601077ed077e171817362adf86ecbde138c4a69d61c520772ef6","text":"供应商"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00005","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874729","source_hash":"f209e1eb4657a31ae2f02ae4ea170a6b6784f7a004037a3047ce7497c28b169c","text":"反转储"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00006","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874730","source_hash":"59011331028577352f2d8037b077f500ee5ee069d806d1bad7f85bded687af86","text":"关税率(%)"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00007","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874731","source_hash":"8787139bed123aaea84e848281860624b89edd5c776eb9f32a89fd23b520c285","text":"男性"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00008","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2874732","source_hash":"2b2f3ea788d7b106230d6418136c8283e1f5ab3237d5c731249f7261a67e0cc2","text":"1. 以下各小段所列公司及其产品出口商"},{"id":"A39690-zh-00009","doc":"A39690","law_id":"kr-014686-263789-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_i